ASCII Art Generator (EX3)

Converts input images into ASCII art in Java with both an algorithm
module and an interactive command-line shell[cite: 34, 42, 43]. Supports
custom character sets, resolution scaling, reverse brightness matching,
and console or HTML output[cite: 34, 42, 47, 48].

Architecture & Packages:
- image: Image loading, padding to powers of two, sub-image splitting,
  and grayscale brightness calculation[cite: 36, 37, 40, 41].
- image_char_matching: SubImgCharMatcher and CharConverter for computing
  character brightness, linear normalization, and closest brightness lookup[cite: 37, 39, 40].
- ascii_art: AsciiArtAlgorithm and Shell for running conversions, caching
  repeated computations, handling exceptions, and processing commands[cite: 37, 41, 43, 44].
- ascii_output: Provided output exporters (console and out.html)[cite: 38, 48].
